#: ../../tools.md:1
msgid "Tools"
msgstr "工具"

#: ../../tools.md:3
msgid ""
"minacode uses tools to inspect your project and act on it. You describe "
"the outcome you want; the agent chooses the tools. Tool calls are shown "
"in the terminal as they run. They are separate from the `/` commands you "
"type yourself. Read-only tools may run concurrently; actions that can "
"change your system ask for confirmation unless `--yolo` or `/yolo` is "
"active."
msgstr ""
"minacode 使用工具检查项目并执行操作。你描述目标，由 agent 选择工具。工具调用会在运行时显示在终端中，它们与你输入的 `/` "
"命令不同。只读工具可以并发运行；可能改变系统的操作会请求确认，除非已启用 `--yolo` 或 `/yolo`。"

#: ../../tools.md:8
msgid "Built-in tools"
msgstr "内置工具"

#: ../../tools.md:15
msgid "Tool"
msgstr "工具"

#: ../../tools.md:16
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../tools.md:17
msgid "**`Read`**"
msgstr "**`Read`**"

#: ../../tools.md:18
msgid ""
"Opens selected line ranges from one or several UTF-8 files. Every "
"returned line has an anchor that later edits can verify."
msgstr "读取一个或多个 UTF-8 文件中的指定行范围。返回的每一行都有可供后续编辑验证的锚点。"

#: ../../tools.md:21
msgid "A shortened result looks like this:"
msgstr "缩短后的结果如下："

#: ../../tools.md:36
msgid ""
"In `684:234ew`, `684` is the zero-based line number and `234ew` is a "
"short hash of that line's content. The line number locates the edit; the "
"hash proves that the line has not changed since it was read."
msgstr ""
"在 `684:234ew` 中，`684` 是从零开始的行号，`234ew` 是该行内容的短 hash。行号用于定位编辑位置，hash "
"用于确认该行自读取后没有变化。"

#: ../../tools.md:39
msgid "**`Search`**"
msgstr "**`Search`**"

#: ../../tools.md:40
msgid ""
"Finds text with case-insensitive regular expressions, optionally limited "
"by path or filename pattern. It skips hidden, binary, and gitignored "
"files and returns editable anchors."
msgstr "使用不区分大小写的正则表达式搜索文本，也可限制路径或文件名模式。它会跳过隐藏文件、二进制文件和被 gitignore 的文件，并返回可编辑锚点。"

#: ../../tools.md:42
msgid "**`InspectCode`**"
msgstr "**`InspectCode`**"

#: ../../tools.md:43
msgid ""
"Finds definitions, references, implementations, callers, callees, and "
"file outlines through the [code index](#code-symbol-index). Use it for "
"code structure rather than exact text."
msgstr ""
"通过[代码索引](#code-symbol-index)查找定义、引用、实现、调用者、被调用者和文件 "
"outline。它适合分析代码结构，而不是精确文本搜索。"

#: ../../tools.md:45
msgid "**`Edit`**"
msgstr "**`Edit`**"

#: ../../tools.md:46
msgid ""
"Creates or changes one UTF-8 file by inserting, replacing, or deleting "
"content. For an anchored change, `Edit` sends back the `line:hash` value "
"returned by `Read`, `Search`, or `InspectCode`. minacode checks the "
"current line immediately before writing and <span "
"class=\"marker\">refuses the edit if the hash no longer matches</span>. "
"Successful edits appear in [`/diff`](usage.md#reviewing-changes)."
msgstr ""
"通过插入、替换或删除内容来创建或修改一个 UTF-8 文件。执行锚点编辑时，`Edit` 会回传 `Read`、`Search` 或 "
"`InspectCode` 返回的 `line:hash`。minacode 会在写入前立即检查当前行；如果 hash 不再匹配，<span "
"class=\"marker\">编辑会被拒绝</span>。成功的编辑会出现在 [`/diff`](usage.md#reviewing-"
"changes) 中。"

#: ../../tools.md:52
msgid "An Edit confirmation previewing the proposed diff"
msgstr "Edit 确认界面预览拟议 diff"

#: ../../tools.md:57
msgid "An Edit confirmation previews the proposed change before approval."
msgstr "确认前，Edit 会预览拟议修改。"

#: ../../tools.md:59
msgid "**`Bash`**"
msgstr "**`Bash`**"

#: ../../tools.md:60
msgid ""
"Runs one shell command in the project with live output. Commands still "
"running after `runtime.bash_wait_timeout` <span class=\"marker\">become "
"background jobs automatically</span>."
msgstr ""
"在项目中运行一条 shell 命令，并实时显示输出。运行超过 `runtime.bash_wait_timeout` 的命令会<span "
"class=\"marker\">自动转为后台任务</span>。"

#: ../../tools.md:63
msgid "A Bash tool call streaming command output in minacode"
msgstr "Bash 工具调用在 minacode 中流式显示命令输出"

#: ../../tools.md:68
msgid "Bash output appears as the command runs."
msgstr "Bash 输出会随命令运行实时出现。"

#: ../../tools.md:70
msgid "**`Job`**"
msgstr "**`Job`**"

#: ../../tools.md:71
msgid ""
"Starts or manages background commands: check output, wait, list, or stop."
" The same jobs are visible through `/ps`."
msgstr "启动或管理后台命令：查看输出、等待、列出或停止。相同任务也可通过 `/ps` 查看。"

#: ../../tools.md:73
msgid "**`Recall`**"
msgstr "**`Recall`**"

#: ../../tools.md:74
msgid ""
"Retrieves a <span class=\"marker\">complete earlier tool result</span>, "
"or selected line ranges, when only a shortened result was placed in the "
"conversation."
msgstr "当对话中只有缩短结果时，取回<span class=\"marker\">完整的早期工具结果</span>或指定行范围。"

#: ../../tools.md:76
msgid "**`RecallContext`**"
msgstr "**`RecallContext`**"

#: ../../tools.md:77
msgid ""
"Retrieves a <span class=\"marker\">compacted conversation segment</span> "
"by its seg.N key when earlier detail was evicted by compaction. Available"
" segments are listed in Memory's history index."
msgstr "当早期细节因 compaction 被淘汰时，按 seg.N 键取回<span class=\"marker\">被压缩的对话 segment</span>。可用 segment 列在 Memory 的 history index 中。"

#: ../../tools.md:79
msgid "**`Note`**"
msgstr "**`Note`**"

#: ../../tools.md:80
msgid ""
"Maintains the task's goal, plan, success check, and learned facts. It "
"keeps long tasks organized but does not edit project files."
msgstr "维护任务 goal、plan、成功检查和已知事实。它帮助组织长任务，但不会编辑项目文件。"

#: ../../tools.md:85
msgid ""
"Plan items are marked `[x]` done, `[~]` in progress, `[ ]` waiting, or "
"`[-]` blocked."
msgstr "Plan 条目使用 `[x]` 表示完成、`[~]` 表示进行中、`[ ]` 表示等待、`[-]` 表示阻塞。"

#: ../../tools.md:86
msgid "**`Ask`**"
msgstr "**`Ask`**"

#: ../../tools.md:87
msgid ""
"Pauses for a decision that genuinely needs you. A question may include "
"choices and a recommended option."
msgstr "在确实需要用户决定时暂停。问题可以包含选项和推荐项。"

#: ../../tools.md:92
msgid ""
"Pressing `Esc` declines the question; typing instead of choosing answers "
"in free text."
msgstr "按 `Esc` 可拒绝问题；直接输入文字可自由回答，而不必选择预设项。"

#: ../../tools.md:93
msgid "**`Skill`**"
msgstr "**`Skill`**"

#: ../../tools.md:94
msgid ""
"Loads an installed skill's full instructions when needed. It appears only"
" when skills are installed; see [Skills](skills.md)."
msgstr "按需加载已安装 skill 的完整指令。仅当存在已安装 skill 时才会出现；见 [Skills](skills.md)。"

#: ../../tools.md:96
msgid "**`MCP`**"
msgstr "**`MCP`**"

#: ../../tools.md:97
msgid ""
"Describes or calls tools and reads resources from a connected MCP server."
" It appears only after a server is connected; see [MCP](mcp.md)."
msgstr "描述或调用已连接 MCP server 的工具，并读取其资源。仅在 server 连接后出现；见 [MCP](mcp.md)。"

#: ../../tools.md:101
msgid "Code symbol index"
msgstr "代码符号索引"

#: ../../tools.md:103
msgid ""
"minacode includes a **code symbol index** for <span "
"class=\"marker\">structured navigation</span> — finding definitions, "
"callers, references, and implementations without relying on an external "
"language server. The index is <span class=\"marker\">built separately for"
" each project</span>."
msgstr ""
"minacode 内置**代码符号索引**，用于<span class=\"marker\">结构化导航</span>：无需外部 language"
" server 即可查找定义、调用者、引用和实现。索引会<span class=\"marker\">按项目分别构建</span>。"

#: ../../tools.md:107
msgid "What it is"
msgstr "它是什么"

#: ../../tools.md:109
msgid ""
"The index is a static database of symbols (functions, classes, methods, "
"variables, etc.) extracted from your project's source files. It is built "
"by a library called [code-symbol-index](https://github.com/hit9/code-"
"symbol-index), which supports a broad set of languages."
msgstr ""
"索引是从项目源文件中提取的符号（function、class、method、variable 等）静态数据库。它由 [code-symbol-"
"index](https://github.com/hit9/code-symbol-index) 构建，支持多种语言。"

#: ../../tools.md:114
msgid "When the index is available, the `InspectCode` tool can:"
msgstr "索引可用时，`InspectCode` 可以："

#: ../../tools.md:116
msgid "**Find symbols** by name with fuzzy matching"
msgstr "按名称进行模糊匹配，**查找符号**"

#: ../../tools.md:117
msgid "**Inspect a symbol** — show its definition and members"
msgstr "**检查符号** — 显示其定义和成员"

#: ../../tools.md:118
msgid ""
"**List references** — call, read, write, and type references across the "
"project"
msgstr "**列出引用** — 项目中的 call、read、write 和 type 引用"

#: ../../tools.md:119
msgid "**Walk call chains** — transitive callers and callees"
msgstr "**遍历调用链** — 递归查找调用者和被调用者"

#: ../../tools.md:120
msgid "**File outlines** — symbol tree of a single file"
msgstr "**文件 outline** — 显示单个文件的符号树"

#: ../../tools.md:122
msgid ""
"Asking where `MCPManager` is defined returns the symbol itself, not every"
" line that mentions the word:"
msgstr "询问 `MCPManager` 在哪里定义时，返回的是符号本身，而不是所有提到该单词的行："

#: ../../tools.md:127
msgid ""
"Each hit carries its file and line range, so the agent can open exactly "
"the right lines. The same index answers \"who calls this\" and \"what "
"implements this\" the same way."
msgstr "每个结果都包含文件和行范围，因此 agent 可以只打开准确位置。同一索引也可以回答“谁调用它”和“谁实现它”。"

#: ../../tools.md:131
msgid ""
"Without an index, `InspectCode` reports that the index is unavailable. "
"Run `/index` once in a project to build it."
msgstr "没有索引时，`InspectCode` 会报告索引不可用。在项目中运行一次 `/index` 即可构建。"

#: ../../tools.md:135
msgid "Building and syncing"
msgstr "构建与同步"

#: ../../tools.md:137
msgid ""
"<span class=\"marker\">Run `/index` to build or rebuild the index.</span>"
" The first build walks every source file; subsequent builds sync from the"
" previous snapshot and are much faster. Add `force` to rebuild from "
"scratch."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"marker\">运行 `/index` "
"构建或重建索引。</span>首次构建会扫描所有源文件；后续构建会基于之前的快照同步，因此快得多。加上 `force` 可从头重建。"

#: ../../tools.md:141
msgid ""
"When an index already exists, minacode refreshes it in the background at "
"startup. After an agent turn, it <span class=\"marker\">automatically "
"updates small batches of changed source files</span>; run `/index` when a"
" large set of changes leaves it stale. `/status` shows the current state:"
msgstr ""
"索引已存在时，minacode 会在启动时后台刷新。Agent 完成一轮后，会<span "
"class=\"marker\">自动更新少量已修改的源文件</span>；如果大量改动导致索引过期，请运行 `/index`。`/status`"
" 会显示当前状态："

#: ../../tools.md:130
msgid "State"
msgstr "状态"

#: ../../tools.md:130
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../tools.md:130
msgid "**synced**"
msgstr "**synced**"

#: ../../tools.md:130
msgid "Index is current and ready"
msgstr "索引已同步，可以使用"

#: ../../tools.md:130
msgid "**stale**"
msgstr "**stale**"

#: ../../tools.md:130
msgid "Out of date; wait for background refresh or run `/index`"
msgstr "索引已过期；等待后台刷新或运行 `/index`"

#: ../../tools.md:130
msgid "**syncing**"
msgstr "**syncing**"

#: ../../tools.md:130
msgid "A background refresh is in progress"
msgstr "正在后台刷新"

#: ../../tools.md:130
msgid "**missing**"
msgstr "**missing**"

#: ../../tools.md:130
msgid "No index exists yet; run `/index`"
msgstr "索引尚未创建；运行 `/index`"

#: ../../tools.md:130
msgid "**error**"
msgstr "**error**"

#: ../../tools.md:130
msgid "The index failed to build or sync; `/status` shows the details"
msgstr "索引构建或同步失败；`/status` 会显示详情"

#: ../../tools.md:154
msgid ""
"The project index is stored in `.code-symbol-index/index.sqlite`. It "
"covers Python, JavaScript, TypeScript, Go, Rust, C, C++, Java, and more."
msgstr ""
"项目索引保存在 `.code-symbol-index/index.sqlite`。支持 "
"Python、JavaScript、TypeScript、Go、Rust、C、C++、Java 等语言。"

